.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.PP
.nf
Style inspired by SAS' enhanced program editor\&. Note This is not
meant to be a complete style\&. It's merely meant to mimic SAS'
program editor syntax highlighting\&.

.fi
.PP
 
